# ============================================================================
#  ⚠️ This file is required. Don't delete it.
#
#  On Windows, git's core.autocrlf is often on by default, turning LF into CRLF on checkout.
#  The diff patches in this repo **must be LF** — they apply on top of the LF source that gdre unpacks,
#  and once a patch turns CRLF no context line matches, so git apply fails wholesale.
#
#  -text marks the patches as "no line-ending conversion", so the cloner's local settings can never change them.
# ============================================================================
*.patch -text
